INSERT INTO cms_page_revisions (id,page_id,locale,version,slug,title,description,body_markdown,created_by_user_id,created_at) VALUES ('seed:docs:troubleshooting:en:v1','seed:docs:troubleshooting','en',1,'troubleshooting','Troubleshooting','Common account, media, Store and stale-interface problems.','## Login or registration does not complete

Confirm that the Cloudflare security check loaded and that cookies are allowed for SourceBoard. If an old tab has stale security state, retry the form from the current page rather than reusing an old submission.

## Firebase says verified but SourceBoard does not

Return to SourceBoard and sign in with the same identity. The login flow synchronizes Firebase verification state. Do not submit a separate legacy token unless the link actually contains one.

## A change appears stale

SourceBoard mutations are designed to reconcile locally or revalidate the current route. If a current production build still requires a manual refresh after a successful mutation, report the page and action because that is treated as a product defect.',NULL,0);
--> statement-breakpoint
